# Golden run of Brakes.dll's brakes on a six-car ЭД9М (G M P M MR GR),
# docs/brakes-dll-replacement.md step 1: the 395 through its positions
# (switch 2: I 0, II 1, III 2, IV 3, VЭ 4, V 5, VI 6), an emergency, the
# start on the move (the controller, switch 0: 6 its zero, 7 the first
# notch) with the КЛУБ's vigilance request answered by the РБ (switch
# 23), two minutes on without it, and at a stand the ЭПК key (switch 26)
# off and on, with the ЭПТ toggle (switch 35) on. RTS's air.
#
#   openrts-train-check <RTS root> --dll mdd_ED9M-0060 mdd_ED9M-0060_G mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_P
#       mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_MR mdd_ED9M-0060_GR --script tests/data/golden/ed9m_brakes.script
#       --record ed9m_brakes.tsv
0    voltage 25000 50
1    switch 2 1
# The ЭПТ toggle (35, ZT_09, key T) on.
2    switch 35 1
# A service step: V 3 s, then III, IV, II.
60   switch 2 5
63   switch 2 2
83   switch 2 3
103  switch 2 1
# VЭ 3 s, IV, II.
143  switch 2 4
146  switch 2 3
156  switch 2 1
# Emergency: VI 10 s, I 5 s, II.
186  switch 2 6
196  switch 2 0
201  switch 2 1
# On the move: the РБ answered 2 s after the КЛУБ's request, then not
# for two minutes.
240  switch 1 3
241  switch 0 6
243  switch 0 7
245.5 switch 23 1
246  switch 23 0
# The controller back; at a stand the ЭПК key off and on, I, II, and the
# РБ answered 2 s after the request that follows.
365  switch 0 6
385  switch 26 0
387  switch 26 1
388  switch 2 0
393  switch 2 1
395.5 switch 23 1
396  switch 23 0
430  expect pipe > 4
430  expect alive == 1
